    "detailed_description": "Shadow\u2019s Bullet is a top-down local multiplayer arena game with a twin-stick shooter gameplay, for 2 to 4 players sharing the same screen.<br><br>Players control agents from the future who have the particularity to become invisible as long as they\u2019re not under a bright light or taking actions.<br><br>Players will fight each other, free for all or in teams, in various game modes, on multiple maps throughout various locations and time periods. Each one with their own game mechanics and traps to discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/e851ff6046193f19e6c4513851506709.poster.avif?t=1707493643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/e851ff6046193f19e6c4513851506709.webm?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/e851ff6046193f19e6c4513851506709.mp4?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everybody is invisible</h2>Be on the lookout for the slightest indication of your opponents' position and choose the right moment to attack. Invisibility creates unexpected actions and increases the tension. More so that you all share the same camera\u2026 Will you be where you think you are?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/06b837dbcb6cdcdbab21c7e5ce8f9b0f.poster.avif?t=1707493643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/06b837dbcb6cdcdbab21c7e5ce8f9b0f.webm?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/06b837dbcb6cdcdbab21c7e5ce8f9b0f.mp4?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Precision and strategy are key</h2>Knowing the position of your opponents is only the first step: you will need precision to hit your targets or they will have the opportunity to react. It's up to you to choose the right time to reveal yourself and take that risk to bring down your target. Will you find the right balance between patience and responsiveness?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to dive in yet competitive</h2>With easy handling and clear rules, the fun is instantaneous. The actions and mechanics at your disposal hold a depth that will allow you to achieve victory if you master it. A game that provokes surprises and laughter, perfect for groups of friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/d2bc4220bec29b91c25fce23a6fc91c8.poster.avif?t=1707493643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/d2bc4220bec29b91c25fce23a6fc91c8.webm?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/d2bc4220bec29b91c25fce23a6fc91c8.mp4?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Personalize your experience</h2>Setup your matches thanks to multiple options, game modes and environments. Fight throughout multiple maps, set on multiple locations and time periods. Discover new mechanics and traps in each environment and learn to use them to win.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/ab96e7ff21ce12dff2449f55018327dd.avif?t=1707493643\" /></div></h2>",
