/extras/06b837dbcb6cdcdbab21c7e5ce8f9b0f.mp4?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Precision and strategy are key</h2>Knowing the position of your opponents is only the first step: you will need precision to hit your targets or they will have the opportunity to react. It's up to you to choose the right time to reveal yourself and take that risk to bring down your target. Will you find the right balance between patience and responsiveness?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to dive in yet competitive</h2>With easy handling and clear rules, the fun is instantaneous. The actions and mechanics at your disposal hold a depth that will allow you to achieve victory if you master it. A game that provokes surprises and laughter, perfect for groups of friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/d2bc4220bec29b91c25fce23a6fc91c8.poster.avif?t=1707493643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/d2bc4220bec29b91c25fce23a6fc91c8.webm?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/d2bc4220bec29b91c25fce23a6fc91c8.mp4?t=1707493643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Personalize your experience</h2>Setup your matches thanks to multiple options, game modes and environments. Fight throughout multiple maps, set on multiple locations and time periods. Discover new mechanics and traps in each environment and learn to use them to win.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161960/extras/ab96e7ff21ce12dff2449f55018327dd.avif?t=1707493643\" /></div></h2>",
    "short_description": "You are both the hunter and the prey in this twin-stick shooter arena game. Two to four players can battle, sharing the same screen, but beware: everybody is invisible. An arcade game for everyone, easy to dive in yet competitive, full of action, tension and surprises.",
